    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9257" root="حنأ" body-key="H">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حنّأ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحْنِىْءٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحْنِئَةٌ</span> <i>He dyed</i> (AZ,
S, K) his head, (AZ, TA,) or his beard, (S,) <i>with</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حِنَّآء</span>: (AZ, S, K:) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حنّأت يَدَهَا</span> <i>She</i> (a woman) <i>dyed her hand therewith;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَنَأَتْهَا</span></b> ,
aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَنَاَ</span></b> . (Msb.)

